      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<size=130%><b><color=#ffd970>AREA 5 - AUDIO</color></b></size>

    A
    cave full of <b>Audio Sources</b> (orange spheres) waiting for your sound clips,
    plus <b>Reverb Zones</b> that add echo. Find free sounds at freesound.org, kenney.nl
    or opengameart.org.


    <b><color=#9fe3ff>TRY THIS</color></b>

    <size=92%>1.
    Drag a water sound onto ''Underground Stream'' and walk around the rings.

    2.
    Change its Spatial Blend to 0 (2D). What changes?

    3. Swap the chamber Reverb
    preset from Cave to Arena.</size>'
